# Build context is the repository root for every image (see the Dockerfiles).
# Keep the context lean: only the projects an image actually builds are copied in,
# so everything else is excluded here.
#
# Two root files are NOT excluded and must not be: components.xml, a runtime
# dependency, and VersionInfo.cs, which Common.csproj and Server.csproj both
# compile via <Compile Include="..\VersionInfo.cs" />. Excluding or forgetting
# VersionInfo.cs fails every image at publish with CS2001.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.git/
**/*.user

# The desktop client. Nova/Ai is the exception: Ai/Nova.Ai.csproj compiles five
# files out of it by link rather than copy, so the AI participant image cannot
# build without them. Excluding all of Nova/ contradicted that Dockerfile
# directly and made the ai-nova-default image unbuildable.
Nova/**
!Nova/Ai/**

Documentation/
Tests/
Tests.Ai/
Tests.ControlPlane/
Tests.ServerHost/
Client/
TestHarness/
Graphics/
ControlLibrary/
GameFileInflator/
infra/
galaxies-web/
DefaultRaces/
GameFiles/
